    <briefdescription>
<para>Describes a single cross-shard serialization conflict. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A conflict record is produced when validateAtPrepare() detects that the requesting transaction&apos;s read or write footprint overlaps with a concurrent SERIALIZABLE transaction in a way that cannot be serialized. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
